<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT THE PILOT PEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Connecticut 1997-08-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$1.04 million Pilot Pen International Tennis Championships on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 6-Petr Korda (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 7-6 (7-4).</p>
<p>8-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 11-Greg Rusedski (Britain)</p>
<p>7-5 4-6 6-3</p>
